WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.560
Everything here is slightly off. Your job is to notice. Hear a tone, then find it again.

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.640
Hit every note on the beat. One hit in this loop is late. Which one?

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:14.600
Nine tiny games about hearing, timing and being confidently wrong.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:18.920
Delulu Beats. Free, and it works offline.
